<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices flat at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices flat at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills held flat at today's primary auction on total demand of 646 million zlotys against a 650 million zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry sold a total of 385 million zlotys worth of the bills.</p>
